 but that's something that  still stuck with me here even a week  later and the same thing goes for the  speakers there's huge modules in it  these big huge enclosures so you think  it would sound good but when we compared  it with the new macbook air well just  take a listen for yourself  [Music]  [Music]  the webcam is also a potato in 2022  terms this might have been the biggest  thing that kind of surprised me because  it is a 720p webcam but the processing  was just terrible back then so i would  probably say you'd want to use something  external if you're going to be doing  that now with that this thing can only  update to mac os catalina so you're not  going to be able to use you know some of  the new features that are released on  the new operating systems you're not  going to get some security updates so  you definitely have to keep that in mind  and before i have to get into  performance and what changing the  thermal paste did  let's talk about this display  it almost hurt my eyes when i first  looked at it just because all the pixels  popped out like crazy and it's really  interesting how our eyes get adjusted to  new displays it becomes a new normal and  displays that didn't look that bad  before they really look bad when you  start looking at them again now if  you're just using this and no other mac  you'll kind of get used to it not  completely because the colors aren't  great but it definitely was the worst  thing about these macbooks not in 2012  when this one launched but at least up  until 2017 which was the last one of  this design with that said this thing  was a hundred and eighty dollars now if  we would look that a year or two ago it  didn't double the price maybe more but  because of apple silicon these old ones  really dropped in value which is great  if you want to pick one up maybe for  yourself a parent that you want using  mac os instead of windows they don't get  any viruses maybe a kid we had multiple  people comment that their kids 