ay so should you buy a 180  2012 macbook air in 2022  well i guess it depends on how much  money you have to spend or who you're  buying it for for a kid or a parent you  can buy one of these not have to worry  about a bunch of windows viruses or  about them breaking expensive machine  and it will do the job great for web  browsing google docs um things like that  they're gonna have a great time or if  you don't have a lot of money to buy say  an 850 m1 macbook air and you need  something there's still a lot of people  using these machines  and they do the job even for a little  bit of light 1080p video editing and  final cut it can actually do that now  you don't want to do 4k that destroys  this machine because its biggest  weakness are graphics and then with that  if you're somebody's going to listen to  a lot of different things with the  built-in speakers of course you can use  headphones or do zoom calls that is more  of a limitation but overall  what else can you buy for this price  point that matches it up really nothing  and this really shows a testament to  apple and how long their machines last  and then with that why in the world are  we still getting eight gig 256 in 2022  but that's for another video so there  you guys go let me know your thoughts  down in the comment section below check  out one of those great videos right over  there click above to subscribe this one  max and i'll see you in the next video  [Music]  you
 

